<node id="Material:regolith_simulants">
  <data key="d0">regolith_simulants</data>
  <data key="d1">Material</data>
  <data key="d2">Regolith simulants whose similarities and differences are analyzed statistically. | Regolith simulants that may differ in fines content, composition, and descriptor distributions. | Regolith simulants developed and assessed as potential representatives of lunar regolith. | Seven different regolith simulants from which particle image data were considered. | Terrestrial substitute materials used in experiments to approximate lunar regolith. | Considered regolith simulants compared via descriptors of shape and texture. | Regolith simulants contrasted with lunar regolith, with large reported differences. | Regolith simulants whose exemplary particles were measured via X-ray tomography.</data>
